"00:21.420">fell </span><span begin="00:21.420" end="00:21.750">in </span><span begin="00:21.750" end="00:23.460">love</span><span begin="00:23.460" end="00:23.880">, </span><span begin="00:23.880" end="00:24.030">or </span><span begin="00:24.030" end="00:24.480">near </span><span begin="00:24.480" end="00:25.860">enough</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:26.670" end="00:31.740"><span begin="00:26.670" end="00:26.790">I </span><span begin="00:26.790" end="00:27.660">gotta </span><span begin="00:27.660" end="00:28.260">tell </span><span begin="00:28.260" end="00:28.710">you </span><span begin="00:28.710" end="00:29.010">the </span><span begin="00:29.010" end="00:30.690">truth</span><span begin="00:30.690" end="00:30.720">, </span><span begin="00:30.720" end="00:31.740">yeah</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:33.570" end="00:37.230"><span begin="00:33.570" end="00:33.750">I </span><span begin="00:33.750" end="00:34.230">wanna </span><span begin="00:34.230" end="00:34.710">grab </span><span begin="00:34.710" end="00:34.980">both </span><span begin="00:34.980" end="00:35.040">of </span><span begin="00:35.040" end="00:35.130">your </span><span begin="00:35.130" end="00:35.670">shoulders </span><span begin="00:35.670" end="00:35.820">and </span><span begin="00:35.820" end="00:36.540">shake</span><span begin="00:36.540" end="00:36.540">, </span><span begin="00:36.540" end="00:37.230">baby</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:37.260" end="00:40.950"><span begin="00:37.260" end="00:38.010">Snap </span><span begin="00:38.010" end="00:38.520">out </span><span begin="00:38.520" end="00:38.730">of </span><span begin="00:38.730" end="00:39.240">it</span><span begin="00:39.240" end="00:39.240">, </span><span begin="00:39.240" end="00:39.240">（</span><span begin="00:39.240" end="00:39.660">snap </span><span begin="00:39.660" end="00:39.960">out </span><span begin="00:39.960" end="00:40.110">of </span><span begin="00:40.110" end="00:40.920">it</span><span begin="00:40.920" end="00:40.950">）</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:40.950" end="00:44.610"><span begin="00:40.950" end="00:41.190">I </span><span begin="00:41.190" end="00:41.430">get </span><span begin="00:41.430" end="00:41.580">the </span><span begin="00:41.580" end="00:42.450">feeling </span><span begin="00:42.450" end="00:42.540">I </span><span begin="00:42.540" end="00:42.900">left </span><span begin="00:42.900" end="00:43.020">it </span><span begin="00:43.020" end="00:43.260">too </span><span begin="00:43.260" end="00:43.740">late</span><span begin="00:43.740" end="00:43.770">, </span><span begin="00:43.770" end="00:43.920">but </span><span begin="00:43.920" end="00:44.610">baby</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:44.640" end="00:48.330"><span begin="00:44.640" end="00:45.390">Snap </span><span begin="00:45.390" end="00:45.900">out </span><span begin="00:45.900" end="00:46.170">of </span><span begin="00:46.170" end="00:46.590">it</span><span begin="00:46.590" end="00:46.590">, </span><span begin="00:46.590" end="00:46.590">（</span><span begin="00:46.590" end="00:47.070">snap </span><span begin="00:47.070" end="00:47.280">out </span><span begin="00:47.280" end="00:47.820">of </span><span begin="00:47.820" end="00:48.270">it</span><span begin="00:48.270" end="00:48.330">）</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:48.330" end="00:51.210"><span begin="00:48.330" end="00:48.570">If </span><span begin="00:48.570" end="00:48.990">that </span><span begin="00:48.990" end="00:49.470">watch </span><span begin="00:49.470" end="00:49.770">don't </span><span begin="00:49.770" end="00:50.400">continue </span><span begin="00:50.400" end="00:50.550">to </span><span begin="00:50.550" end="00:51.210">swing</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:51.210" end="00:54.870"><span begin="00:51.210" end="00:51.360">Or </span><span begin="00:51.360" end="00:51.480">the </span><span begin="00:51.480" end="00:52.140">fat </span><span begin="00:52.140" end="00:53.070">lady </span><span begin="00:53.070" end="00:53.670">fancies </span><span begin="00:53.670" end="00:54.150">having </span><span begin="00:54.150" end="00:54.240">a </span><span begin="00:54.240" end="00:54.870">sing</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:54.900" end="00:59.460"><span begin="00:54.900" end="00:55.050">I'll </span><span begin="00:55.050" end="00:55.260">be </span><span begin="00:55.260" end="00:55.860">here </span><span begin="00:55.860" end="00:56.910">waiting </span><span begin="00:56.910" end="00:57.270">ever </span><span begin="00:57.270" end="00:57.540">so </span><span begin="00:57.540" end="00:58.470">patiently </span><span begin="00:58.470" end="00:58.890">for </span><span begin="00:58.890" end="00:59.070">you </span><span begin="00:59.070" end="00:59.460">to</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:59.460" end="01:10.980"><span begin="00:59.460" end="01:00.450">Snap</span><span begin="01:00.450" end="01:00.510">, </span><span begin="01:00.510" end="01:01.380">out</span><span begin="01:01.380" end="01:01.470">, </span><span begin="01:01.470" end="01:02.310">of</span><span begin="01:02.310" end="01:02.370">, </span><span begin="01:02.370" end="01:03.570">it</span><span begin="01:03.570" end="01:10.980">.</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:10.980" end="01:17.280"><span begin="01:10.980" end="01:12.690">Forever </span><span begin="01:12.690" end="01:13.350">isn't </span><span begin="01:13.350" end="01:15.660">for </span><span begin="01:15.660" end="01:17.280">everyone</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:18.480" end="01:25.710"><span begin="01:18.480" end="01:18.990">Is </span><span begin="01:18.990" end="01:20.220">forever </span><span begin="01:20.220" end="01:20.820">for </span><span begin="01:20.820" end="01:22.770">you</span><span begin="01:22.770" end="01:25.710">?</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:25.710" end="01:32.760"><span begin="01:25.710" end="01:25.890">It </span><span begin="01:25.890" end="01:26.460">sounds </span><span begin="01:26.460" end="01:26.790">like </span><span begin="01:26.790" end="01:28.170">settling </span><span begin="01:28.170" end="01:30.330">down </span><span begin="01:30.330" end="01:30.510">or </span><span begin="01:30.510" end="01:31.140">giving </span><span begin="01:31.140" end="01:32.760">up</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:33.030" end="01:38.430"><span begin="01:33.030" end="01:33.390">But </span><span begin="01:33.390" end="01:33.720">it </span><span begin="01:33.720" end="01:34.110">don't </span><span begin="01:34.110" end="01:34.710">sound </span><span begin="01:34.710" end="01:35.130">much </span><span begin="01:35.130" end="01:35.610">like </span><span begin="01:35.610" end="01:37.200">you</span><span begin="01:37.200" end="01:37.230">, </span><span begin="01:37.230" end="01:38.430">girl</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:40.020" end="01:43.710"><span begin="01:40.020" end="01:40.200">I </span><span begin="01:40.200" end="01:40.680">wanna </span><span begin="01:40.680" end="01:41.190">grab </span><span begin="01:41.190" end="01:41.490">both </span><span begin="01:41.490" end="01:41.580">your </span><span begin="01:41.580" end="01:42.150">shoulders </span><span begin="01:42.150" end="01:42.270">and </span><span begin="01:42.270" end="01:42.960">shake</span><span begin="01:42.960" end="01:42.960">, </span><span begin="01:42.960" end="01:43.710">baby</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:43.740" end="01:47.400"><span begin="01:43.740" end="01:44.490">Snap </span><span begin="01:44.490" end="01:44.970">out </span><span begin="01:44.970" end="01:45.240">of </span><span begin="01:45.240" end="01:45.690">it</span><span begin="01:45.690" end="01:45.690">, </span><span begin="01:45.690" end="01:45.690">（</span><span begin="01:45.690" end="01:46.140">snap </span><span begin="01:46.140" end="01:46.470">out </span><span begin="01:46.470" end="01:46.680">of </span><span begin="01:46.680" end="01:47.370">it</span><span begin="01:47.370" end="01:47.400">）</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:47.400" en