">a </span><span begin="02:59.790" end="03:00.360">sing</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:00.420" end="03:05.040"><span begin="03:00.420" end="03:00.570">I'll </span><span begin="03:00.570" end="03:00.810">be </span><span begin="03:00.810" end="03:01.380">here </span><span begin="03:01.380" end="03:02.460">waiting </span><span begin="03:02.460" end="03:02.790">ever </span><span begin="03:02.790" end="03:03.090">so </span><span begin="03:03.090" end="03:04.020">patiently </span><span begin="03:04.020" end="03:04.440">for </span><span begin="03:04.440" end="03:04.620">you </span><span begin="03:04.620" end="03:05.040">to</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:05.040" end="03:06.000"><span begin="03:05.040" end="03:06.000">Snap</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:06.060" end="03:06.930"><span begin="03:06.060" end="03:06.930">Out</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:07.020" end="03:07.830"><span begin="03:07.020" end="03:07.830">Of</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:07.830" end="03:07.890"><span begin="03:07.830" end="03:07.890">It</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:07.920" end="03:09.270"><span begin="03:07.920" end="03:08.370">The </span><span begin="03:08.370" end="03:09.270">end</span></p></div></body></tt>